  "description": "Market Is Moving UP FAST ⬆️",
  "body_html": "<p>What a great Friday in the stock market! Congratulations to all those that went into Compass Inc., COMP, with me yesterday, it blasted up over +10% in a single day. Before anyone asks, no, I am not selling, though my stop has been pushed up to take some risk off the table. I am NOT a day trader and like to chase much larger runs than 10%. </p><p>If you are new, we do these weekly wrap-ups every Friday, in case you missed anything. The S&amp;P 500 has yet to make an all time high, however it is trending there. The VIX is still in a comfortable position, trending downwards. </p><p>Things we talked about this week, in case you missed it:</p><ul><li><p> <em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/this-stock-looks-bullish-oil?r=4z8lgl\">A Stock To Buy &amp; Why Oil, Natural Gas is Bearish Still</a></strong></em></p></li><li><p><em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-overview-for-2026?r=4z8lgl\">How We Are Improving Our 2026 Stock Market Game</a></strong></em></p></li><li><p><em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/why-stocktok-is-getting-more-expensive?r=4z8lgl\">Why StockTok Is Getting More Expensive</a></strong></em></p></li></ul><p><strong>By end of day, the price for StockTok will go from $8 a month to $41.86 a month. </strong>Annual subscribers get 2 months for free. <strong>If you are already subscribed, you will be grandfathered in…your price will not change! </strong>Check out the article for reasoning…and don’t hesitate to tag me if you have a question, <em><strong>I read everything here.</strong></em> </p><p>Hope you have a great weekend…be sure to take some time away from the charts. Coming in Monday morning frazzled, typically does not lead to better performance lol. Thanks for stopping by. 👍</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
